<title>INDIA: INDIA ROCKLAND BONUS MEET ON AUG 30.</title>
<headline>INDIA ROCKLAND BONUS MEET ON AUG 30.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board of India's Rockland Leasing Ltd. will meet for a bonus share issue on August 30, the Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) said in a notice on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Bombay equities desk +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
